<title>USA: Air Products air separation unit operational.</title>
<headline>Air Products air separation unit operational.</headline>
<dateline>LEHIGH VALLEY, Pa. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air Products and Chemicals Inc said Monday its air separation plant at its industrial gas complex in the Netherlands is now operational.</p>
<p>The unit, at the Air Products facility in Rozenburg, near Rotterdam, will produce more than 3,000 tons of oxygen per day, the company said. It will also produce large quantities of nitrogen and argon.</p>
